{'symbol': 'GPC', 'date': '2023-06-01 16:30:00', 'title': 'GENUINE PARTS COMPANY ANNOUNCES NEW BOARD MEMBER', 'text': "DARREN REBELEZ NAMED TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS ATLANTA\xa0, JUNE 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GENUINE PARTS COMPANY (NYSE: GPC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPOINTED DARREN REBELEZ AS A NEW INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR OF THE COMPANY. MR. REBELEZ IS THE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF CASEY'S GENERAL STORES, INC. (NASDAQ: CASY), THE THIRD LARGEST CONVENIENCE RETAILER AND FIFTH LARGEST PIZZA CHAIN IN THE UNITED STATES, WHERE HE IS RESPONSIBLE FOR THE COMPANY'S OVERALL STRATEGIC PLAN AND OPERATING SUCCESS."}